Progress/Status: Package 1- 100% of civil works completed. Main civil works output includes: installation of 27,448 medium voltage (MV) poles; stringing of 1,897 cct-km of conductor; installation of 36 km of underground cable; installation of 613 transformers; and installation of 252 switchgear. All sub-transmission lines have been tested and handed over to EDC branch offices for operations.
